        "description": "Nhà hàng Thắng Chung – cơm nhà sàn truyền thống tại Tuyên Quang, nổi tiếng với các món cơm bình dân, cá kho, rau rừng, thịt rang… Không gian gỗ ấm cúng, rộng rãi, phù hợp cho đoàn khách và khách lẻ trên hành trình khám phá núi rừng Đông Bắc. Nestled along National Road 2 in Ham Yen, Tuyen Quang, Thang Chung Restaurant offers travelers a warm welcome and a taste of authentic Vietnamese countryside cuisine. Built in the style of a traditional stilt house with polished wooden pillars and rustic interiors, the restaurant brings a cozy, home-like dining experience. The menu features flavorful, home-cooked dishes such as claypot brais Thang Chung Restaurant offers a cozy stilt-house dining experience in Tuyen Quang. Known for homestyle Vietnamese dishes like braised fish, forest vegetables, and pork specialties. Spacious and friendly – ideal for both travelers and groups passing through Northeast Vietnam. #Vietnamesecuisine #Localfood #Affordablemeals #Countrysidestop #TuyenQuangspecialties",
